  "id": "ayahuasca",
  "term": "ayahuasca",
  "definition": "Ayahuasca is a psychedelic compound that has drawn interest as a possible rapid-acting treatment for treatment-resistant depression. In psychology and mental health ethics, discussion of ayahuasca includes not only its possible effects but also ethical, methodological, and real-world questions about how useful it may be in clinical care.",
